rops":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["住院康复每天几百元，自费的那部分因地而异。时间按月算。每天都要练，很枯燥。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Cochrane 系统综述纳入 29 项试验、5902 名参与者，比较有组织的住院卒中单元照护和其他照护方式。随访到末次（中位 1 年）时，不良结局（死亡、残障或者需要机构照护）的比值比是 0.77（95% CI 0.69–0.87，可信范围），死亡的比值比是 0.76（95% CI 0.66–0.88），死亡或者依赖他人的比值比是 0.75（95% CI 0.66–0.85），证据质量中等。换算成绝对数，每 100 人接受卒中单元照护，多 2 人存活、多 6 人住在家里、多 6 人生活自理。另一方面，AVERT 试验在 5 个国家的 56 个急性卒中单元随机分配 2104 名患者，比较「常规照护」和「常规照护加超早期高强度活动」。三个月时结局良好（改良 Rankin 量表 0—2 分）的，超早期组 480 人（46%），常规组 525 人（50%），调整后比值比 0.73（95% CI 0.59–0.90，P=0.004）。死亡是 88 人比 72 人，没有做出差别（比值比 1.34，95% CI 0.93–1.93，P=0.113）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Langhorne P, Ramachandra S; Stroke Unit Trialists' Collaboration (2020). Organised inpatient (stroke unit) care for stroke: network meta-analysis. Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, 4:CD000197. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD000197.pub4","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD000197.pub4"]},"；AVERT Trial Collaboration group (2015). Efficacy and safety of very early mobilisation within 24 h of stroke onset (AVERT): a randomised controlled trial. Lancet, 386(9988):46-55. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(15)60690-0","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(15)60690-0"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD000197.pub4","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["争议：这两项证据都来自卒中，套到脊髓损伤、截肢、烧伤这些别的致残原因上属于往外推。AVERT 那一项说明的是「越早越猛」不成立，不是「早期活动没用」。试验里两组绝大多数人都在 24 小时内下了床，差的是频次和总量。挑机构时看它有没有康复医学科、有没有专职的康复治疗师和作业治疗师，别只看招牌上「康复」两个字。基层和三级医院之间怎么转、起付线怎么算，见第 24 节第 1 条（逐级转诊）。社区康复和辅助器具配置见本节第 7 条（去县级残联问全）。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/33-15"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"右下肢或者双下肢没了也能考驾照，准驾车型叫 C5"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/33-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"听力下降就去配助听器，配它的理由是听得见，不是防痴呆"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/33-12"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["导盲犬可以带进公共场所和公共交通，盲人免费坐市内公交"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["法律写明，公共场所和公共交通要为带导盲犬、导听犬、辅助犬的残疾人提供便利。盲人凭有效证件免费坐市内公交、地铁和渡船，残疾人可以免费带随身必…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/33-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["残疾人参加高考可以申请合理便利，用盲文卷的考试时间加一半"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["残疾考生参加高考，可以申请盲文卷、大字卷、免外语听力、单独考场、带助听器和轮椅进场，考试时间也能延长。这些不会自动给，要按省里规定的时间交…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/33-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["残疾孩子申请入学，学校不得拒收；到不了校的由教育局安排送教上门"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["幼儿园和各类学校，对符合条件的残疾孩子申请入学不得拒收，普通职业学校也一样。孩子需要专人护理、到不了学校的，由县教育局安排送教上门或远程上…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/33-18"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["说一个成年人「管不了自己的事」，要向法院申请认定，家属说了不算"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一个成年人是不是「无民事行为能力」或者「限制民事行为能力」，只有法院能认定。家属、单位、居委会都不能自己说了算。要由利害关系人或者有关组织…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/33-19"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["成年人的监护人按法定顺序定；被监护人伤了别人，由监护人赔"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成年人失去行为能力后，监护人按顺序来：配偶，父母和子女，其他近亲属，最后是愿意担任的其他人或组织。争起来了由居委会、村委会或民政部门指定，…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/33-20"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["因为残疾被拒招、不转正、少发钱，可以告，但先把过程成本算清"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["法律禁止在招用、转正、晋级、评职称、报酬、社保上歧视残疾人。你可以向主管部门投诉，也可以去法院告。但打赢了官司，对方也不替你出律师费。所以…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/33"},"children":["阅读整个主题：残疾之后怎么活"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"广告 · 社区推荐"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"生财有术官方 Logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["广告 · 社区推荐"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["读过的知识，能不能做成有用的产品？"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["从电子书、资料到小工具，看看圈友怎样发现需求，把内容变成实际交付。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&sc_placement=ad_footer"},"children":["看看社区与案例",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"18","height":"18","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","